# dependencies
node_modules/

# environment files
#
# DELIBERATE: server/.env and client/.env ARE committed. This is a private repo and a
# four-person college project, and the alternative was three teammates blocked on setup.
# Decided 2026-07-25 by the project owner, with eyes open.
#
# THE REPOSITORY CANNOT BE MADE PUBLIC AS-IS. Real credentials are in the history, so
# flipping visibility leaks them even if the files are deleted first. Before open-sourcing:
# rotate the Supabase database passwords and JWT_SECRET, re-ignore these two files, and
# only then change visibility. See README.md.
#
# They are un-ignored rather than force-added on purpose: a force-added file stays ignored,
# so edits never appear in `git status` and a rotated password would silently reach nobody.
.env*
!.env.example
!server/.env
!client/.env

# build output
client/dist/
dist/
build/

# logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# test coverage
coverage/

# editor / OS
.claude/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# uploads / generated runtime artifacts
uploads/
tmp/
